# The repository stores text files with LF endings only, and `npm run format:check`
# (an oxfmt gate that CI enforces) rejects CRLF. Without this file a Windows clone
# with core.autocrlf=true checks every file out as CRLF, so format:check fails locally
# on files the developer never touched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.vsix binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
